      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "Ten more MultiQC panels, one per FastQC or Cutadapt module: GC content, adapter contamination, duplication, length distribution, N content and overrepresented sequences. They start collapsed because each only becomes interesting once a panel above has flagged something. A tile inside a collapsed section is also never fetched, so opening this section is what triggers the requests.",
